<description>&lt;p&gt;Syria is publicly denying any deployment of its forces to Yemen, while simultaneously confirming the dispatch of troops to Saudi Arabia to fight the Houthis. Jordan and Syria have deepened cooperation, signing eleven agreements covering economic projects, security coordination and a rail link, and senior officials say bilateral ties are at their strongest in decades. Heavy clashes erupted in the Damascus countryside around Wadi Barada, and Syrian security forces entered the Roj camp ahead of foreign repatriations. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNblcxNmEtNGhBdjc4aGNsQzl6XzJ4czRfT0d5S2loc3lmODh3Y3lpbFF1emhrQmFYMlR5YUpYRDVuWGtQbHAtWXlVMWZvakVKRFZpeTN3bEhRbHpCR2NUZGU0Ti1iVWtCbENiZWt2YVhLQ0dTVU84eGljbHRSaU04QlVoLXI5TEUzeW0zN2dYd1hXWjZnd1VFMkp3MXJnelo4N29vU3VzQjdyUUFwQjQ4Qno5bGVaZHB1?oc=5&quot;&gt;MEMRI | Middle East Media Research Institute&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTEFVX3lxTE81eU5ManRQMDVOb0g5dnBSa3JmbDdRejN5Ykdrd2hHeXdwVkJ2VzNiSU52RWZZMWp4S05TSG54cVlLZWVFQVczcHRTZDE?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQSzBWd1dwMzdac0J4TUk2bV96SnlfanBXSU1RVnpxMTZKWjZDUmdIQ0tWazlYSHNyQ2FrVWJjdllwSWRUZlNGRkhobmFWbUlTSDdjeUNXZWstTDdxZ1hNYkhDbklGU0h5bGhkSjliN3FuNVNRNk5GQUFkdDBFM0FMT3V2WDE1OTVKUl9HX3FZV2NtWnRzdGVPUWhaeFVVQm9CTmV1VkNhc2RMUXMxNHRQVEpqSG5HZTJXRUdV?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء الاردنية&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE5OSXQ3RTZ0T2N4VW1sR3ZFdW1NazIwcjJWMnplOGxKUUhOcUwwYzRkelpSaEhMaXQ3OU9WVHBnYWVQUXJiRkdScVQ0dTlFc082dk04V3duQWtGMVlVMnVtSjNXWWhwSlhmM3pEVVlZbUI1QTVzaXQwcjNLQVhLaHc?oc=5&quot